    over them.  \r\nPress <b><color=#A9A9A9>W</color></b> to open the <b><color=#A9A9A9>Inventory</color></b>
    panel.  \r\nPress <b><color=#A9A9A9>Q</color></b> to open the <b><color=#A9A9A9>Equipment</color></b>
